[4.8] - 14.04.2026
Fixed
- Auth() without await on 401 re-auth — caused StackOverflow
- GetMember used HTTP DELETE instead of GET — was deleting members
- DateTime format hh→HH — 12-hour times shifted by 12 hours after noon
- AddScheduledDate called ScheduledDatetimeUtc instead of ScheduledDate
- GetJson race condition on JsonConvert.DefaultSettings — thread safety
- Infinite recursion on repeated 401 — now stops after one retry
- includeArchived:false still added include_archived=y to query
- ValueAttachmentData [JsonProperty("Name")] → "name"
- IndexOutOfRangeException in UpdateCatalog.AddOrUpdateItem
- NullReferenceException in Comment methods when Text/FormattedText is null
- NullReferenceException in GetEnumMemberValue when [EnumMember] missing

